---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout>
  <h1>Audit API</h1>

  <h2>Endpoints</h2>

  <table class="key-table">
    <tr>
      <th>Method</th>
      <th>Path</th>
      <th>Permission</th>
      <th>Purpose</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>GET</code></td>
      <td><code>/api/v1/audit</code></td>
      <td><code>audit:view</code></td>
      <td>Query audit log (JSON/CSV, page pagination)</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>Supports <code>?action=</code>, <code>?userId=</code>, <code>?fromDate=</code>, <code>?toDate=</code>, <code>?page=</code>, and <code>?format=csv</code>. Returns entity names as clickable links with contextual <code>meta</code> data (review decisions, role changes).</p>
</DocsLayout>
